{"u": "10769188452", "name": "Eat Everything In A Grocery Store", "place": "128201586883489", "created": "2026-10-03", "updated": "2026-10-17T14:43:19.793Z", "genre": "Adventure", "subgenre": "Scavenger Hunt", "desc": "The doors are locked. The shelves are full. 4,300,000 calories of food... and you have to eat EVERYTHING.\n\n🍎 CLICK TO EAT: aim, click, chomp! Apples, Choco Puffs, Bloxy Cola, stockroom pallets, even a 150,000-calorie Mega Watermelon. Every item breaks apart bite by bite.\n💪 HIT THE GYM: calories are your currency. Spend them at the in-store gym on Hold to Eat, Speed, Multi Eat (up to x12!), Calories and Reach.\n👥 SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS: start a party in the lobby. Same store, more mouths: clear it faster together!\n📖 FOOD INDEX: taste all 175 foods to complete your collection. Can you find the hidden golden banana?\n💰 $1,000,000 PRIZE: empty the store and split the million (in-game cash) with your team.\n🏆 LEADERBOARDS: most calories eaten and fastest store cleared.\n\nThe real-life challenge took 113 days. How fast can YOU clear it?", "desc_hash": "a5f3ebaece59", "max_players": 12, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 1438512, "favorites": 23827, "creator": {"id": 245799052, "name": "Play On Grocery Store", "type": "Group", "verified": false}, "daily": {"2026-10-17": {"updated": "2026-10-17T14:43:19.793Z", "visits": 1438512, "fav": 23827, "up": 1523, "down": 289}}, "passes": [{"name": "VIP", "price": 299}, {"name": "Starter Pass", "price": 99}], "products": [{"name": "Little Cash Pack", "price": 29}, {"name": "Large Cash Pack", "price": 199}, {"name": "XXXL Cash Pack", "price": 799}, {"name": "XXXXL Cash Pack", "price": 1699}, {"name": "XXXXXL Cash Pack", "price": 2499}, {"name": "Medium Cash Pack", "price": 79}, {"name": "XXL Cash Pack", "price": 399}, {"name": "Feeding Frenzy", "price": 49}, {"name": "Bacon Army", "price": 79}, {"name": "Pizza Party", "price": 99}, {"name": "Super Golden Relay", "price": 149}, {"name": "Fo